# SD card removed: fault alert, monitoring and alerts continue, card back is detected
present: seri-tool 0\.\d+\.\d+ \(SIM x60\) booting
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: OK\s*$
in-order: PRINTER\| .* SD CARD FAULT
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: Memory card fault
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: Temp HIGH 31\.0C
in-order: PRINTER\| .* SD CARD OK
